Data and references
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Chinese lunisolar month boundaries 1901-2100 were derived from the Hong Kong
Observatory "Gregorian-Lunar Calendar Conversion Tables", one text file per year
(e.g. https://www.hko.gov.hk/en/gts/time/calendar/text/files/T2027e.txt). Calendar dates are facts;
the HKO is credited as the source. The tables themselves are not redistributed.

Official holiday dates are taken from decrees published by the Government of the
Republic of Indonesia (setkab.go.id, setneg.go.id, kemenkopmk.go.id,
jdih.kemnaker.go.id, peraturan.bpk.go.id, kemenag.go.id). Each record links to
its source. The project claims no rights in the decrees themselves.

Research captures of other calendar websites used during development are not
part of this repository or of any release, and are not covered by its licenses.
